<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέξ-ειμι</span></b> , (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶμι</span>”
				<i>ibo) withdraw gradually,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.120
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				7.211
			</span></i>: generally, <i>withdraw, disappear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν μηθὲν ἔτι ὑπεξίῃ . . λυπηρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Metrod.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; of fire or snow, <i>disappear gradually,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				103d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				106a
			</span></i>; of water, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγίγνεσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1276a39
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>make way for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἕνας ἀρχὰς ταῖς νέαις ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					25.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>go out to meet</i> or <i>against</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.176
			</span></i> codd. (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεξ-</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>issue forth from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλάμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>to be discharged,</i> of the faeces, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.42
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
